  "sourceScopeNotes": [
    "Haiku: 90% short-prompt token-price reduction is distinct from vendor-estimated 75% average task-cost reduction; prompt boundary includes 100,000 tokens. Arithmetic example is an explicitly hypothetical editorial calculation, not a measured workload result.",
    "EU imports: 86% PHEV and 40% BEV growth concern all EU imports, not China-only shipments. The report says year to September without defining exact endpoints; the article uses neutral figures-through-September language. Talks were scheduled, with no verified concluded agreement in the cited advance report.",
    "Ukraine: Reuters update on 2026-10-08 at 04:44 UTC supersedes 28/20 with at least 32 nationwide and 22 in Pryluky. The five-child detail remains attached only to the older count. OHCHR figures concern its earlier reporting period and are not added to October casualties.",
    "Airports: Saudi statement did not attribute both Saudi incidents or assign each airport to a specific day. Houthis claimed Riyadh targeting; Yemen transport ministry attributed Aden; coalition reported its own strikes. WFP figures are October 2 context, not effects of the later attacks.",
    "Markets: October 7 session summary; 96 bp term-premium high dates to October 5. No figures are presented as live October 8 quotes. Reuters Trading Day is commentary; term premium is estimated, not directly observed.",
    "AI poll: 84% is perceived threat to American workers among registered voters, not measured displacement. Forum forecasts and safety warnings remain attributed opinions.",
    "ERCOT item withheld: numeric claims not verified against accessible original analysis or primary data; no replacement statistics invented."
  ],
